================================================================================
REFERENCE FACE DETECTOR (FaceBoxes) — NOTE
================================================================================

The reference face-counter plugin in AI/face-count-service/ wraps a pre-trained
face detector. By default it uses FaceBoxes [Zhang et al., IJCB 2017]. The
plugin's own glue code is MIT licensed (see AI/face-count-service/LICENSE),
but the detector weights and inference library are distributed by their
upstream authors under their own licenses, which should be reviewed before
production use. The plugin's README documents how to swap in a different
detector.


